anders series and includes Instant Spitfire and Instant Hot Streak. Expand your gameplay experience with over 40 Skylanders and vehicles to collect.\n\nSkylands is in peril! Kaos has unleashed his most evil weapon yet \u2013 the Doomstation of Ultimate Doomstruction. With all of Skylands on the verge of collapse, a special team called the SuperChargers has been assembled to pilot an unstoppable fleet of incredible vehicles. Now you and the SuperChargers must embark on epic adventures over land, under sea, and through the sky to stop Kaos and save Skylands!", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/skylanders-superchargers", "videos": [{"id": 55762, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "qhA_OdbUs5w", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qhA_OdbUs5w", "title": "Skylanders Superchargers Launch Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/qhA_OdbUs5w/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 55760, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "RrI51I-zuuk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RrI51I-zuuk", "title": "Official Trailer: \u201cLarge and SuperCharged\u201d l Skylanders Superchargers l Skylanders", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/RrI51I-zuuk/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 55761, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "8eyMn3gKO0U", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8eyMn3gKO0U", "title": "Official Trailer: Rise of the Sky Eater l Skylanders Superchargers l Skylanders", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8eyMn3gKO0U/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 2188, "name": "Skylanders"}]}